  "title": "Swedish Chocolate Balls (Chokladbollar)",
  "description": "Swedish for &#34;chocolate ball,&#34; chokladbollar are the easiest wholesome snack around; Chef John packs his with oats, cocoa, coffee, and coconut oil for sustained energy.",
